    \item \textbf{6} languages: C++, Go, Java, JS, Python, Rust
    \item Metric: \textbf{\% correct} after 2 attempts
    \item Zero human intervention — fully autonomous
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{8pt}
  \colorbox{primary}{\parbox{0.92\linewidth}{%
    \centering\vspace{6pt}%
    {\fontsize{30}{38}\selectfont\color{textgray} Models ranked by pass rate on real-world code-editing tasks}\vspace{6pt}%
  }}
}

% Edit Format Compliance
\posterbox[ambercard, title={Edit Format Compliance}
]{name=format, column=1, between=row11 and row16}{
  \fontsize{34}{44}\selectfont
  \begin{itemize}[itemsep=14pt]
